All Bible verses found in this program, whether in .csv files or elsewhere, are in the public domain. They are generally exact copies of Catholic Public Domain Version verses; the CPDV, translated and edited by Ronald L. Conte Jr., is available at https://sacredbible.org/ . (Some modifications to the verses have been made in order to make them more compatible with this game; for instance, I removed trailing whitespaces and converted curly quotes to single ones.)

